<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Mask R-CNN 실습 코드 on Study Notes</title><link>https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/mldnn/dnn/3_object_detection/mask_rcnn_sample/</link><description>Recent content in Mask R-CNN 실습 코드 on Study Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/mldnn/dnn/3_object_detection/mask_rcnn_sample/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title/><link>https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/mldnn/dnn/3_object_detection/mask_rcnn_sample/readme/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/mldnn/dnn/3_object_detection/mask_rcnn_sample/readme/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="mask-r-cnn-학습-코드-구조-익히기"&gt;Mask R-CNN 학습 코드 구조 익히기&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mask R-CNN 학습 파이프라인의 &lt;strong&gt;구성 요소와 순서를 학습하기 위한&lt;/strong&gt; 샘플 코드입니다.
성능이 아니라 &amp;ldquo;각 단계가 왜 필요하고 무엇을 하는지&amp;quot;를 이해하는 데 초점을 맞췄습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="1-빠른-시작"&gt;1. 빠른 시작&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;pip install -r requirements.txt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;python make_dummy_dataset.py --num-images &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;python train.py --epochs &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; --batch-size &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;첫 실행 시 COCO 사전학습 가중치(약 170MB)를 자동으로 내려받습니다.
오프라인 환경이라면 &lt;code&gt;--no-pretrained&lt;/code&gt; 를 붙이세요 (학습은 되지만 성능은 낮습니다).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;학습이 끝나면 &lt;code&gt;outputs/&lt;/code&gt; 에 체크포인트, 학습 기록, GT/예측 시각화 이미지가 저장됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>